\par\par \b \uc2 OFF DUTY --- Design & Decorating: A Call to Home-Office Order --- Whether you're living with ad hoc storage or just want a refresh, here are some chic suggestions\b0\par\par\uc2 By Nina Molina \par \uc2 420 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 February 2022\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par D4\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Some of us have never committed to properly outfitting a home office, pressing into service random hand-me-downs and college leftovers. But if, as seems likely, the future of toil includes some form of working from home, the need to store suffocating piles of work-related ephemera more elegantly can't be ignored. Juliana Lima Vasconcellos, an architect and interior designer in Rio de Janeiro, finds that clients prioritize calm in their home workspaces. So we found cabinets with soothing good looks, most of which can tuck under your desk and replace the anarchy of folders and envelopes stashed there.\par \par \uc2 ---\par \par \uc2 UNORDINARY ORGANIZERS / THREE STORAGE OPTIONS TO SPIFF UP YOUR WORKSPACE\par \par \uc2 A Plum Job\par \par \uc2 Originally designed in 1994, Kartell's Italian-made rollable storage features drawers of recycled plastic for eco-conscious home-office workers. Its painted-metal hardware and frame limn a chic, monochromatic silhouette, while three new colors help you escape the grayscale doldrums of standard-issue office furniture: pale blue, pale green and this rich, jammy plum. "Orange, red and other warm colors will bring comfort," Ms. Vasconcellos said. Kartell Matte Mobil 3 Drawer Storage with Wheels, about $829, Kartell.com\par \par \uc2 A Sturdy Supporter\par \par \uc2 The boxy utility of Room & Board's file cabinet is offset by its earthy hue and on-trend matte-lacquer finish. "This is an elegant color. I think it would be beautiful in a room with a lot of wood," Ms. Vasconcellos said of the Copenhagen File Cabinet in sage. The case, made of medium-density fiberboards (MDF), can be furnished with casters or a steel base. Jenon Bailie, director of merchandise and design at \uc2 Room & Board\uc2 , said, "My daughter just got one that she uses at college as file storage and as a nightstand." $699, RoomAndBoard.com\par \par \uc2 A Natural Selection\par \par \uc2 Ms. Vasconcellos's favorite of the bunch, this Indonesia-constructed file cabinet, with its oak veneer and grasscloth-fronted drawers, brings nature back into the home, an aesthetic move desired by many of her clients today. Sebastian Brauer, vice president of product design and development at \uc2 Crate & Barrel\uc2 , praises the "casual, laid-back look" of the cabinet. At 30 inches tall, it might not fit under a desk, but its finer proportion lets it easily double as a living-room side table. Granger Small Natural Oak File Cabinet, $499, CrateAndBarrel.com\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020220226ei2q0002w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
